From: Codex automation <codex@localhost>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 16:50:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] regulator: add bounded MP2762A charge inhibit test

---
 drivers/regulator/Kconfig                |   1 +
 drivers/regulator/mp2762-charge-test.h   | 143 ++++++++++
 drivers/regulator/mp2762-otg-regulator.c | 325 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 459 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/regulator/mp2762-charge-test.h

diff --git a/drivers/regulator/Kconfig b/drivers/regulator/Kconfig
index 1c97d0808..10498c6fc 100644
--- a/drivers/regulator/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/regulator/Kconfig
@@ -1892,6 +1892,7 @@ config REGULATOR_QCOM_LABIBB
